<h2>Your subscription cancellation is confirmed</h2>

<p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>

<p>
  We've received your request to cancel your <strong>{{tierLabel}}</strong> plan on Spiriment.
</p>

<div class='info-box'>
  <p style='margin: 0 0 10px 0;'><strong>Plan:</strong> {{tierLabel}}</p>
  <p style='margin: 0;'><strong>Access until:</strong> {{accessUntilLabel}}</p>
</div>

<p>
  You'll keep full access to your <strong>{{tierLabel}}</strong> features until
  <strong>{{accessUntilLabel}}</strong>. After that, your account will move to
  <strong>Free</strong> access — you can still use Spiriment at no cost.
</p>

<p>
  Changed your mind? You can resubscribe anytime from the app before or after your access ends.
</p>

<p style='text-align: center;'>
  <a href='spiriment://profile' class='button'>Open Spiriment</a>
</p>

<p style='margin-top: 30px;'>
  Blessings,<br />
  <strong style='color: #3A5A40;'>The Spiriment Team</strong>
</p>
